      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5548419332580319456, guid: a32e814df3ade4a4da7a246921a9b7dc,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: serializedProgramAsset
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1c1dabace3c87094296b96c691bf1f39,
        type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 6590067031822985451, guid: a32e814df3ade4a4da7a246921a9b7dc,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6590067031822985451, guid: a32e814df3ade4a4da7a246921a9b7dc,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[0]
      value: "<align=center><b>Quantum Simulation 3D</b></align>\r\nProvides three
        models of quantum experiments scaled at 1:1000 (1 metre equals 1 millimetre).\r\n\r\n<indent=4%>\u29BF
        Low (16-80V) voltage electrons.\r\n\r\n\u29BF Bach, Pope et al. electron
        diffraction (2012).\r\n\r\n\u29BF Zeilinger et al. cold neutron diffraction
        (1988)."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6590067031822985451, guid: a32e814df3ade4a4da7a246921a9b7dc,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[1]
      value: "<align=center><b>Quantum Simulation 3D</b></align>\r\n1:1000\u306E\u30B9\u30B1\u30FC\u30EB\uFF081\u30E1\u30FC\u30C8\u30EB\u30921\u30DF\u30EA\u30E1\u30FC\u30C8\u30EB\u306B\u63DB\u7B97\uFF09\u3067\u518D\u73FE\u3057\u305F\u30013\u7A2E\u985E\u306E\u91CF\u5B50\u5B9F\u9A13\u30E2\u30C7\u30EB\u3092\u63D0\u4F9B\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002\r\n\r\n<indent=4%>\u29BF
        \u4F4E\u96FB\u5727\uFF0816\uFF5E80V\uFF09\u96FB\u5B50\u7DDA\u3002\r\n\r\n\u29BF
        Bach\u3001Pope\u3089\u306B\u3088\u308B\u96FB\u5B50\u56DE\u6298\u5B9F\u9A13\uFF082012\u5E74\uFF09\u3002\r\n\r\n\u29BF
        Zeilinger\u3089\u306B\u3088\u308B\u51B7\u4E2D\u6027\u5B50\u56DE\u6298\u5B9F\u9A13\uFF081988\u5E74\uFF09\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6590067031822985451, guid: a32e814df3ade4a4da7a246921a9b7dc,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[2]
      value: "<align=center><b>\u4E09\u7DAD\u91CF\u5B50\u6A21\u64EC</b></align>\r\n\r\n\u63D0\u4F9B\u4E09\u7A2E\u4EE5
        1:1000 \u6BD4\u4F8B\u7E2E\u653E\u7684\u91CF\u5B50\u5BE6\u9A57\u6A21\u578B\uFF081
        \u516C\u5C3A\u7B49\u65BC 1 \u6BEB\u7C73\uFF09\u3002\r\n\r\n<indent=4%>\u29BF
        \u4F4E\u96FB\u58D3\uFF0816-80V\uFF09\u96FB\u5B50\u3002\r\n\r\n\u29BF Bach\u3001Pope
        \u7B49\u4EBA\uFF0C\u300A\u96FB\u5B50\u7E5E\u5C04\u300B\uFF082012\uFF09\u3002\r\n\r\n\u29BF
        Zeilinger \u7B49\u4EBA\uFF0C\u300A\u51B7\u4E2D\u5B50\u884D\u5C04\u300B\uFF081988\uFF09\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6590067031822985451, guid: a32e814df3ade4a4da7a246921a9b7dc,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[3]
      value: "<align=center><b>\u91CF\u5B50\u6A21\u62DF 3D</b></align>\r\n\u63D0\u4F9B\u4E09\u79CD\u6309
        1:1000 \u6BD4\u4F8B\u7F29\u653E\uFF081 \u7C73\u76F8\u5F53\u4E8E 1 \u6BEB\u7C73\uFF09\u7684\u91CF\u5B50\u5B9E\u9A8C\u6A21\u578B\u3002\r\n\r\n<indent=4%>\u29BF
        \u4F4E\u538B\uFF0816\u201380 V\uFF09\u7535\u5B50\u3002\r\n\r\n\u29BF Bach\u3001Pope
        \u7B49\u4EBA\u7684\u7535\u5B50\u884D\u5C04\u5B9E\u9A8C\uFF082012 \u5E74\uFF09\u3002\r\n\r\n\u29BF
        Zeilinger \u7B49\u4EBA\u7684\u51B7\u4E2D\u5B50\u884D\u5C04\u5B9E\u9A8C\uFF081988
        \u5E74\uFF09\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6590067031822985451, guid: a32e814df3ade4a4da7a246921a9b7dc,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[4]
      value: "<align=center><b>Quantum Simulation 3D</b></align>\r\n1:1000 \uBE44\uC728(1\uBBF8\uD130\uB97C
        1\uBC00\uB9AC\uBBF8\uD130\uB85C \uCD95\uC18C)\uB85C \uAD6C\uD604\uB41C \uC138
        \uAC00\uC9C0 \uC591\uC790 \uC2E4\uD5D8 \uBAA8\uB378\uC744 \uC81C\uACF5\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4.\r\n\r\n<indent=4%>\u29BF
        \uC800\uC804\uC555(16-80V) \uC804\uC790.\r\n\r\n\u29BF Bach, Pope \uB4F1\uC758
        \uC804\uC790 \uD68C\uC808 \uC2E4\uD5D8(2012).\r\n\r\n\u29BF Zeilinger \uB4F1\uC758
        \uB0C9\uC911\uC131\uC790 \uD68C\uC808 \uC2E4\uD5D8(1988)."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6590067031822985451, guid: a32e814df3ade4a4da7a246921a9b7dc,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[5]
      value: "<align=center><b>Simula\xE7\xE3o Qu\xE2ntica 3D</b></align>\r\nOferece
        tr\xEAs modelos de experimentos qu\xE2nticos em escala de 1:1000 (1 metro
        equivale a 1 mil\xEDmetro).\r\n\r\n<indent=4%>\u29BF El\xE9trons de baixa
        tens\xE3o (16-80 V).\r\n\r\n\u29BF Difra\xE7\xE3o de el\xE9trons de Bach,
        Pope et al. (2012).\r\n\r\n\u29BF Difra\xE7\xE3o de n\xEAutrons frios de
        Zeilinger et al. (1988)."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6590067031822985451, guid: a32e814df3ade4a4da7a246921a9b7dc,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[6]
      value: "<align=center><b>Simulation quantique 3D</b></align>\r\nPropose trois
        mod\xE8les d'exp\xE9riences quantiques \xE0 l'\xE9chelle 1:1000 (1 m\xE8tre
        \xE9quivaut \xE0 1 millim\xE8tre).\r\n\r\n<indent=4%>\u29BF \xC9lectrons
        \xE0 basse tension (16-80 V).\r\n\r\n\u29BF Diffraction d'\xE9lectrons (Bach,
        Pope et al., 2012).\r\n\r\n\u29BF Diffraction de neutrons froids (Zeilinger
        et al., 1988)."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6590067031822985451, guid: a32e814df3ade4a4da7a246921a9b7dc,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: serializationData.Prefab
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 6590067031822985451, guid: a32e814df3ade4a4da7a246921a9b7dc,
        type: 3}
